==Latin==

===Etymology===
From {{affix|la|mūs|t1=a mouse|-culus|pos2=diminutive suffix|lit=little mouse}}. The {{m-g|muscle}} sense is a {{semantic loan|la|grc|μῦς||mouse; muscle|nocap=1}}.<ref>{{R:itc:EDL|page=396}}</ref>

===Pronunciation===
* {{la-IPA|mūsculus}}

===Noun===
{{la-noun|mūsculus<2>}}

# {{lb|la|literally}} {{dim of|la|mūs}}: a [[small]] [[mouse]]
# {{lb|la|transferred sense}}
## a [[companion]] of the [[whale]]
## a [[saltwater]] [[mussel]]
## {{lb|la|anatomy}} a [[muscle]]
## {{lb|la|military}} a [[shed]], [[mantelet]], [[shielding]]
